    {
      "id": 238331,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-06-08T17:11:42.714Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh man, C&amp;A are Rewall fans? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> This is the best!</p>\n<p>Maaan, Sky-Scraper is just the bet. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> I hope she makes an honest woman out of Paige someday.</p>\n<p>Portja is now a bi icon. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Sky-Scraper alone on Christmas because she’s systematically dismantled all her human relationships is the saddest thing ever. ;_;</p>\n<p>They set out to make a supporting cast for Sky-Scraper, which consists of government handler, almost-friend, almost-boyfriend, therapist, and I think that puts a fine point on all her personal problems.</p>\n<p>“Thank you for grabs.” XD</p>\n<p>I’m glad I wasn’t the only one thinking about Hul’s relation to singular entities and the sandwich bag, I think I wrote almost the same letter. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>“Did anyone say they wanted to know you?” Cult of Gloom on point with the insults once again.</p>\n<p>And good on them for helping combat some of the stigma around therapy and mental health treatment. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> This was a good episode.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-06-08T17:11:42.714Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 21,
      "readers_count": 20,
      "score": 9.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 28596,
      "topic_slug": "episode-178-of-the-letters-page-creative-process-sky-scraper-supporting-cast",
      "display_username": "KateWalker",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
